### Summary of Changes

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| `electron/src/main.ts` | Add `shell` import, add `setWindowOpenHandler` and `will-navigate` handler |
| `electron/src/preload.ts` | Add `openExternal` method to exposed API |
| `apps/web/src/types/electron.d.ts` | Add `openExternal` to `ElectronAPI` interface |
| `apps/web/src/components/chat/MarkdownRenderer.tsx` | Update `a` component to use click handler |

### Testing Checklist

