```

---

## Files to Modify

| File | Changes |
|------|---------|
| `apps/server/src/index.ts` | Collect tool calls during streaming, save to metadata |
| `apps/server/src/routes/chats.ts` | Optionally transform metadata to top-level (or handle in frontend) |
| `packages/utils/src/index.ts` | Update `transformApiMessage` to extract from metadata |

---

## Detailed Implementation Steps

### Step 1: Update Backend - Collect and Save Tool Calls

**File: `apps/server/src/index.ts`**

Find the message saving section (around line 300-400):

