---

## Testing Checklist

- [ ] New chat with tool calls - tools visible during streaming
- [ ] Navigate away from chat, return - tools still visible
- [ ] Restart app, load chat - tools visible
- [ ] Tool call status preserved (success/error)
- [ ] Tool call results preserved
